1583- *  #258:  Decode COP0 STATUS/CAUSE (and below, FPU FCSR) into named
1584- *  bit-fields under the raw-hex register dump. Display-only. R2000/R3000
1585- *  (EXC3K) STATUS keeps a 3-deep KU/IE stack + diag bits where R4000+
1586- *  (EXC4K) has KSU/ERL/EXL; the EXC3K ExcCode field is 4 bits, not 5.
1587- */
